"><div class="rounded-500 relative overflow-hidden translate-x-0 translate-y-0" style="aspect-ratio:4/3" data-translation-key="72f2dd22-ad9b-4e2a-8651-2240fe5192c9"><video autoplay="" disablepictureinpicture="" loop="" muted="" playsinline="" class="h-full w-full object-cover"><source data-src="https://storyblok-cdn.photoroom.com/f/191576/x/fcabee7e74/remove_background_feature_01.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video></div></div><div class="mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 lg:ps-16"><div class="flex-1"><h2 class="heading-thin-600 text-balance">Go from product photo to sale in minutes</h2></div><div class="body-light-600 text-content-secondary flex flex-1 flex-col gap-8"><span class="**:[word-break:break-word] [&amp;_a[href]]:text-current [&amp;_a[href]]:underline [&amp;_a:not([href])]:no-underline! [&amp;_b]:font-500 [&amp;_strong]:font-500 [&amp;_code]:break-all [&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_p_code]:rounded-400 [&amp;_p_code]:bg-background-subdued [&amp;_p_code]:inline-block [&amp;_p_code]:px-1.5 [&amp;_p_code]:align-middle [&amp;_p_code]:text-600 [&amp;_p_code]:font-500 [&amp;_p_code]:before:[content:&#39;&#39;] [&amp;_p_code]:after:[content:&#39;&#39;] [&amp;_blockquote]:[quotes:none] [&amp;_blockquote_p]:before:[content:&#39;&#39;] [&amp;_blockquote_p]:after:[content:&#39;&#39;] [&amp;_ul]:mt-3 [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:ps-4 [&amp;_.inline-next-element+*]:inline [&amp;_li+li]:pt-2 [&amp;_*[id]]:scroll-mt-20 [&amp;&gt;div&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0"><div><p>Eliminate costly and time-consuming photo editing processes so you can focus resources on growing your business. Whether you’re an independent seller or a global brand, quickly remove backgrounds with AI for <a target="_self" href="https://www.photoroom.com/use-cases/sell-online">online store</a> or <a target="_self" href="https://www.photoroom.com/industry/marketplaces">marketplace</a>-ready product photography that sells.&nbsp;</p></div></span><div><a class="focus-visible:misc-border-size-focus-ring relati