/storyblok-cdn.photoroom.com/f/191576/144x176/78351541ab/source_nick_hawkins.webp/m/3840x0/filters:quality(80):no_upscale():format(webp) 3840w" src="./cover9_files/filters_quality(80)_no_upscale()_format(webp)(32)" data-darkreader-inline-color=""></div><div class="component-light-600 text-content-subdued-primary"><span class="**:[word-break:break-word] [&amp;_a[href]]:text-current [&amp;_a[href]]:underline [&amp;_a:not([href])]:no-underline! [&amp;_b]:font-500 [&amp;_strong]:font-500 [&amp;_code]:break-all [&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_p_code]:rounded-400 [&amp;_p_code]:bg-background-subdued [&amp;_p_code]:inline-block [&amp;_p_code]:px-1.5 [&amp;_p_code]:align-middle [&amp;_p_code]:text-600 [&amp;_p_code]:font-500 [&amp;_p_code]:before:[content:&#39;&#39;] [&amp;_p_code]:after:[content:&#39;&#39;] [&amp;_blockquote]:[quotes:none] [&amp;_blockquote_p]:before:[content:&#39;&#39;] [&amp;_blockquote_p]:after:[content:&#39;&#39;] [&amp;_ul]:mt-3 [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:ps-4 [&amp;_.inline-next-element+*]:inline [&amp;_li+li]:pt-2 [&amp;_*[id]]:scroll-mt-20 [&amp;&gt;div&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0"><div><p>“I’m really skeptical when it comes to AI photography and photo editing because I am a photographer, but Photoroom’s AI Backgrounds always looks great and realistic.”</p></div></span></div><div><div class="component-semi-strong-500 text-content-primary">Nick Hawkins</div><div class="component-light-400 text-content-secondary">Founder, The 1994 Candle Co.</div></div></div><a class="focus-visible:misc-border-size-focus-ring relative inline-flex w-fit max-w-full appearance-none items-center justify-center truncate overflow-hidden text-center outline-hidden transition-all duration-200 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed bg-background-default text-content-white-primary-inverted hover:bg-background-hover focus-visible:bg-background-hover focus-visible:ring-misc-focus-indicator active:bg-background-down rounded-500 disabled:opacity-30" aria-busy="false" data-translation-key="446b022a-0beb-4fdc-80d0-14a55011001b" href="https://www.photoroom.com/customer-stories/1994-candle-co"><div class="relative flex max-w-full items-center justify-center content-to-edge-spacious-px-600 size-h-600"><span class="max-w-full truncate component-500">Read story</span></div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="py-e500 px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8 xl:px-10"><div class="align-center mx-auto flex flex-col justify-center max-w-sm sm:max-w-lg lg:max-w-[640px]"><div class="pb-i200"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1200px] flex flex-col gap-4 items-center text-center" data-translation-key="a6741b59-a05d-4146-b82e-53ed4df1f2d4"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 items-center"><div class="flex w-full items-start gap-4 heading-thin-800 sm:heading-extra-thin-900 justify-center"><h2 class="w-full max-w-[760px] text-balance">Edit images automatically with the API</h2></div></div></div></div><div class="body-600 sm:body-700 text-content-secondary pb-i300 text-center"><span class="**:[word-break:break-word] [&amp;_a[href]]:text-current [&amp;_a[href]]:underline [&amp;_a:not([href])]:no-underline! [&amp;_b]:font-500 [&amp;_strong]:font-500 [&amp;_code]:break-all [&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_p_code]:rounded-400 [&amp;_p_code]:bg-background-subdued [&amp;_p_code]:inline-block [&amp;_p_code]:px-1.5 [&amp;_p_code]:align-middle [&amp;_p_code]:text-600 [&amp;_p_code]:font-500 [&amp;_p_code]:before:[content:&#39;&#39;] [&amp;_p_code]:after:[content:&#39;&#39;] [&amp;_blockquote]:[quotes:none] [&amp;_blockquote_p]:before:[content:&#39;&#39;] [&amp;_blockquote_p]:after:[content:&#39;&#39;] [&amp;_ul]:mt-3 [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:ps-4 [&amp;_.inline-next-element+*]:inline [&amp;_li+li]:pt-2 [&amp;_*[id]]:scroll-mt-20 [&amp;&gt;div&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0"><div><p>Remove objects, retouch, resize, and recolor across your whole catalog through a single API. No manual editing, no queue.</p></div></span></div><a class="focus-visible:misc-border-size-focus-ring relative inline-flex w-fit max-w-full appearance-none items-center justify-center truncate overflow-hidden text-center outline-hidden transition-all duration-200 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed bg-background-default text-content-white-primary-inverted hover:bg-background-hover focus-visible:bg-background-hover focus-visible:ring-misc-focus-indicator active:bg-background-down rounded-500 disabled:opacity-30 [&amp;_div]:component-strong-600 self-center" aria-busy="false" href="https://www.photoroom.com/api"><div class="relative flex max-w-full items-center justify-center content-to-edge-spacious-px-700 size-h-700"><span class="max-w-full truncate component-600">Explore the API</span></div></a></div></div><script type="application/ld+json" id="faq-jsonld">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the best background remover for product photos?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Photoroom is built specifically for e‑commerce and brand visuals. Our AI background remover instantly erases backgrounds, leaving a transparent backdrop that you can replace with a studio or lifestyle setting, if necessary."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does an AI background remover work?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Upon uploading an image, Photoroom’s AI background remover detects and isolates the main subject of your image (a product, person, or object), separating it from the background before erasing it."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I remove the background from an image without losing quality?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"With Photoroom, you can remove the background from any image while preserving every detail. Our AI background remover maintains image resolution, sharpness, and edge precision, so your product or subject remains crisp and natural."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there a free background remover that works on mobile and desktop?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Photoroom is available on mobile and desktop. You can get started for free to remove backgrounds, and when you're ready, upgrade to access more AI photo editing tools and high-resolution exports."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How can I automatically remove and replace a background with a new one?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Upload your photo to Photoroom, and our AI background remover automatically erases the background. Keep it transparent, or replace it with a professional studio setup, lifestyle scene, or custom backdrop with AI Backgrounds."}}]}</script><section id="faq-block" class="py-e700 px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8 xl:px-10 bg-neutral-50"><div class="gap-i600 lg:gap-i500 mx-auto flex max-w-[1200px] flex-col lg:flex-row"><div class="w-full shrink-0 lg:w-[360px] lg:pt-2"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1200px] flex flex-col gap-4 items-start text-start" data-translation-key="2d11be54-a2d5-4916-9acf-25a8a190904d"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 items-start"><div class="component-700 max-w-[760px] text-content-accent">Background Remover</div><div class="flex w-full items-start gap-4 heading-thin-800 sm:heading-extra-thin-900 justify-between"><h2 class="w-full max-w-[760px] text-balance">Frequently asked questions</h2></div></div></div></div><div class="divide-misc-divider border-misc-divider grow divide-y border-t"><article><div class="group/faq-question flex cursor-pointer flex-row items-start justify-between gap-4 py-4 outline-hidden sm:py-6" role="button" aria-controls="faq-answer-_R_6kpllav5sqivb_"><h4 class="component-600 sm:component-700 max-w-[640px] pt-[5px] [word-break:break-word] sm:pt-[3px]">What is the best background remover for product photos?</h4><button type="button" class="focus-visible:misc-border-size-focus-ring relative inline-flex max-w-full appearance-none items-center justify-center truncate overflow-hidden text-center outl